            "action_name": {
              "value": "Target Culprit"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "The commando designates a single creature as their culprit. The commando gains a +2 circumstance bonus to Perception checks to Seek their culprit and a +2 circumstance bonus to Survival checks to Track their culprit. The commando's attacks deal an additional 2d8 precision damage to the culprit. This designation lasts for 24 hours or until the commando targets another creature with this ability."
            },
